o one of the biggest conspiracies in American history.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Mystery\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":159770,\"title\":\"The Dirties\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1oPjkd0200Nt7sdLRqp5Ot1oPxK.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/i7qr46eFLeOYes1bttvV2anq553.jpg\",\"rating\":6.2,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"The line between reality and fiction starts to blur when two best friends start making a movie about getting revenge on bullies.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":913814,\"title\":\"Brian and Charles\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pzP3N9qRo3S91QjfBFWNI0ph0AY.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/sT0c22syDUXXz85Gg0E7dzZzCaA.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"An endearing outlier, Brian lives alone in a Welsh valley, inventing oddball contraptions that seldom work. After finding a discarded mannequin head, Brian gets an idea. Three days, a washing machine, and sundry spare parts later, he’s invented Charles, an artificially intelligent robot who learns English from a dictionary and proves a charming, cheeky companion. Before long, however, Charles also develops autonomy. Intrigued by the wider world — or whatever lies beyond the cottage where Brian has hidden him away — Charles craves adventure.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1056784,\"title\":\"Or We Die Trying\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qHmJUxmngP63IRfnRmPvwhyxkyk.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/unEzxoTOXUNffbPI0BM4y3Sasph.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Three high schoolers investigate the disappearance of a fellow student, Aubrey. She was last seen entering the abandoned back hallways of their school, Asher Academies. There is a legend that the founder of the school, Asher Neal, died in the back halls and now his ghost haunts that half of the school, but no one believes that. However, as the team continues to investigate Aubrey's disappearance, the presence of a ghost seems more and more real.\",\"genres\":[\"Thriller\",\"Drama\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1656982,\"title\":\"Growth Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/A78JacufG9wnGAUAOnWQxSEjWxs.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bxRslz62XMkKJILrtFSEPcOh6DX.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A day in the life of a man who’s trying to be the tallest person in the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":268340,\"title\":\"Against Their Will\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tyF6FsTa2ifeXymHhZhxhZyyx75.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v5vrb4TEdPz80zz32T7J5M9qUNI.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two beautiful and different girls, Alice and Lisette are 17 years old, when forcibly removed from their Alsatian family to cooperate in the war effort in Germany. After spending six months in a indoctrination camp, they are both sent to a munitions factory where they are tasked to perform inhuman works. An explosion erupts, they are suspected of sabotage and threatened with being sent to a boot camp. Alice and Lisette believe they saved when transferred to a maternity where they continue living the hell of war.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"War\",\"TV Movie\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":479685,\"title\":\"Life in Gray\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zviQIOzALTiBavws2adc2yF3YZW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tqIsXN3BZoxLw4cGhW1rKjmNgZG.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A faux documentary about the ongoing social, political and economical crisis in Brazil, where the government cuts the colors of Rio de Janeiro, turning the city black and white.\",\"genres\":[\"Documentar